{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40079","label":"MEMORIES TELLER · Part 1"},"label":"Into the Water: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_ce006_1_05_s","next":"event_ce006_1_06_s","speakers":{"roam":"Roam","ce006_03_op":"Lily","ce006_npc_01_op":"Adam","ce006_01":"EVE","elegg_op":"Elegg","anis":"Anis","rapi":"Rapi","neon":"Neon"},"icons":{"roam":"si_c931_00_s","ce006_03_op":"si_c852_00_s","ce006_npc_01_op":"si_c853_00_s","ce006_01":"si_c850_00_s","elegg_op":"si_c500_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_1","text":"This place is very wet. Very squishy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Drain","bgArt":"drain","image":null,"bgm":"collab_bgm_sb_field_floodedcs_inst","movie":null,"shown":["rapi","roam","ce006_01","anis"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_2","text":"Not good for treads.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_3","text":"There will be a lot of water pooled up in that area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ce006_03_op"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_4","text":"Usually, there'd be equipment preventing that from happening, but the place hasn't exactly been maintained as of late.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_5","text":"That means that water has been continuously seeping out, even if it does so at varying speeds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ce006_npc_01_op"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_6","text":"There's a high chance that there's an obstruction of some kind there. If that's moved out of the way, the water will drain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_7","text":"I'll take a look around. Is the scan function still not working?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_8","text":"Nope. It's been kaput ever since we arrived.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_9","text":"To be exact, the scan function is operational, but it's not detecting anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_10","text":"Ms. Lily, Mr. Adam, and I were discussing that a few moments ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["elegg_op"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_11","text":"When we tried to scan the Tetrapod's power source and detailed schematics, it was like looking through a lens that was fogged up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_12","text":"Despite the fact that everything seemed normal to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_13","text":"Same for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_14","text":"Adam and I took the opposite approach and took apart some of Elegg's machines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_15","text":"Parts that we were already familiar with showed up clear as day, but when it came to the power source or detailed schematics, the results came back blurred beyond recognition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_16","text":"That must mean we can't share technology between our worlds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_17","text":"It would seem so. However, that might be by design.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_18","text":"Technology that we use here without a second thought could cause a quantum leap elsewhere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_19","text":"Gatekeeper could be doing this deliberately to maintain a sort of balance,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_20","text":"negating anything that could cause a major shift between different worlds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_21","text":"That's unfortunate. It would have been nice to take something back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_22","text":"I know. It pretty much shatters the dream of sharing technology between worlds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_23","text":"That's a shame, for sure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_24","text":"We might have come across some useful discoveries.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_25","text":"At least you'll always be able to retain the memories.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_27","text":"Is something wrong, EVE?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_28","text":"Nothing's wrong. It's just... that was a rather poetic line, Roam.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_29","text":"I know many good lines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_30","text":"Tell me again why you had to tag along.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_31","text":"I might discover new artifacts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_32","text":"The more artifacts, the better for the second Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_33","text":"You're nothing if not industrious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_34","text":"I always work hard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_35","text":"Is that your main function? Gathering artifacts?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_36","text":"Affirmative. That is what I must do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_37","text":"Why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_38","text":"I do not remember.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_39","text":"I do remember it is my duty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_40","text":"Doesn't it get boring?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_41","text":"No, it does not. Because it is something I must do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_42","text":"Hehe, I think I could learn a few things from you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_43","text":"What do you do in your own world, EVE?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_44","text":"Me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_45","text":"... I fight with the Naytiba.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_46","text":"All the time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_47","text":"Yes. All the time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_48","text":"Doesn't that become monotonous?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_49","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_50","text":"I never gave it much thought.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_51","text":"It was something I had to do, and so I did it. With everything I had.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_52","text":"Same as me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_53","text":"Heh, I suppose you're right. You and I are pretty similar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_54","text":"Nobody move!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_55","text":"Raptures detected up ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_56","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_56","text":"Ahead of us lies a massive tunnel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_theruinedcity_a","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_57","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_57","text":"The entrance is blocked","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_05_e_58","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_05_e_58","text"